WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
Leave all these K1 people and belongings behind

2
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,500
I have something else to tell you

3
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:10,540
Don't bring anything with you

4
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:11,780
Just follow me tomorrow

5
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:15,380
It's a good thing that you can go to her place with Miss Han. Captain Lu said yes.

6
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,460
Who has she praised from you?

7
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:17,860
Follow Miss Han

8
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:19,060
We made the right choice

9
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,660
They really have the strength to take us away

10
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:28,680
Who knows what's there? Old Kang Tiantian, please go home to me. Don't be sad when you get there.

11
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:31,280
Let's send you a message over the radio, okay?

12
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:38,440
I'm waiting for your news, sir

13
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,160
Net flowers and leaves are the future of mankind

14
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:41,560
You know it yourself

15
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:45,060
Do you want to know whether the base develops regardless of the situation?

16
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:47,060
It turns out to be Captain Lu. Go on your way.
